<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67276" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετώπ-ιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτωπον</span>
			, <i>forehead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.95
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				16.739
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>façade</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					282 ii 20
				</span></i>
			 (Priene, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>margin</i> of a book, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).634
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				159
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bandage for the forehead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).803
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>aromatic Egyptian ointment containing</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτωπον</span> III, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.59
			</span></i>; <i>containing oil of bitter almonds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.688f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				7.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμυγδάλινον ἔλαιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.33
			</span></i>, <u>Gloss.</u>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νε&lt;&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώπιον</span></span>.</div>
